  "title": "Adani Enterprises Policy Commitments, Environment and Social Policies",
  "summary": "This page presents Adani Enterprises' Policy Commitments (GRI 2-23), noting its Board-approved governance framework, employee/supplier training, and sustainability compliance. It lists environment policies (ESG, climate change, environment, energy, biodiversity, resource conservation, waste, water stewardship) with focus points, stakeholder groups, and responsible authorities. It also details social policies (diversity, human rights, OHS, CSR, freedom of association, POSH, stakeholder engagement, grievance management, supplier code) with focus points, stakeholders, and authorities. Stakeholder groups include employees, investors, customers, communities, government, suppliers, and CRC Customers, with Board-level review and CRC/RMC/CSRC oversight.",
}
